      "content": "thanks. i'll try the vodka thing. but i'm looking at it now and it's actually a pretty deep hole, like i can see the tissue inside a bit. i'm also starting to feel kinda shivery and my foot is pulsing. should i take some ibuprofen for the pulsing or is there something better i can take at home to stop it from getting worse? i really want to avoid the doctor if possible.",
